DESCRIPTION:A middle-aged Tehranian man\, Mr. Badii (Homayoun Ershadi) is i
 ntent on killing himself and seeks someone to bury him after his demise. D
 riving around the city\, the seemingly well-to-do Badii meets with numerou
 s people\, including a Muslim student (Mir Hossein Noori)\, asking them to
  take on the job\, but initially he has little luck. Eventually\, Badii fi
 nds a man who is up for the task because he needs the money\, but his new 
 associate soon tries to talk him out of committing suicide. Directed by Ab
 bas Kiarostami.
